# Template-only exclusions: this repo is used as a starting point for new
# projects. These are ignored here so the template itself stays clean; once
# you instantiate a real project from it, un-ignore (remove the line below)
# whichever of these your project actually uses:
# - .claude, CLAUDE.md: un-ignore only if the new project keeps using that
#   tooling/config; otherwise leave ignored or delete them.
.claude
CLAUDE.md
